{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0805"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge music-stage/pop-rock","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/music-stage__pop-rock.g3.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",916],["+","By then the band had already outlived its own predictions: in 1975 "],["=",2],["+","Jagger, born in 1943, had said he would rather be dead than sing „Satisfaction“ when he was 45 – and he was still singing it on stage past the age of 80. "],["=",2],["-","later"],["+","also"],["=",56]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",862],["+","Da hatte die Band ihre eigenen Prognosen längst überlebt: 1975 hatte der 1943 geborene "],["=",4],["+","gesagt, er wäre lieber tot, als mit 45 noch „Satisfaction“ zu singen – und er sang es noch jenseits der 80 auf der Bühne. Jagger "],["=",2],["-","später,"],["+","auch,"],["=",50]]}]},
